# The pause menu (START; src/game/settings.h, main.c draw_pause_menu): in play, START pauses and
# the menu's up; R turns the debug text off (the cursor starts on it: the readout top left goes),
# L three times to the cycle's shape and R makes it the next one (linked -> ribbon), START plays on
# with the ribbon and no readout, and the menu's gone. Filmed from iso (DOWN), to see the cycle
wait_boot
skip_prologue
press down
wait 2.5
shot pm_0_riding
press start
wait 0.6
shot pm_1_paused
press r
wait 0.6
shot pm_2_debug_text_off
press l 3
press r
wait 0.6
shot pm_3_ribbon
# Flying the camera (the d-pad) puts the menu away; L brings it back (the cursor on to the next)
hold up 0.4
wait 0.3
shot pm_3b_flying
press l
wait 0.5
shot pm_3c_back
press start
wait 1.0
shot pm_4_playing_on
